  The rest are the substrings that you wanted.
  For example:
  regex(lorem,\" \\([A-Za-z]*\\) \\([A-Za-z]*\\) \",maxMatches=3)
  => {\" ipsum dolor \",\"ipsum\",\"dolor\"}
  This means if you have n groups, you want maxMatches=n+1
